                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Quake 4 is a sequel to Quake 2...\n\nThe story of Quake 4 is good (it reminds me of DOOM 3)\ngameplay: PRACTICALLY the same as DOOM 3... and very good\nsoundtrack: good rock!!!\naiming is good\ngraphics are nice\ncharacter modeling is well done\n\nThere's not much to criticize about Quake 4.... it's a Quake worth having...\nespecially for DOOM and DOOM 3 fans specifically!\n\nWhat I'm hoping for is a new Quake with the essence of the current DOOM and the current Wolfenstein... where are you at, ID Software and Bethesda?",
